{"id":"cdca8bcec9339871","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-generated-topology.md","title":"ZFC Filter7 Filter Generated Topology","display":"df-zfc-filter7-filter-generated-topology — ZFC Filter7 Filter Generated Topology","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-generated-topology","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-generated-topology"],"display":"df-zfc-filter7-filter-generated-topology — ZFC Filter7 Filter Generated Topology","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-generated-topology"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter7-filter-generated-topology</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter7-filter-generated-topology — ZFC Filter7 Filter Generated Topology"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d1121e6ff027ff98\" href=\"?note=d1121e6ff027ff98\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d1121e6ff027ff98\" href=\"?note=d1121e6ff027ff98\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterGeneratedTopology}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterGeneratedTopology}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}filter\\text{-}generated\\text{-}topology} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterGeneratedTopology}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(X)))\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F(x),X)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal F(x)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in U\\land\\exists V\\in\\mathcal F(x)\\;\\forall y\\in V\\;(U\\in\\mathcal F(y))\\bigr)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;(U\\in\\mathcal F(x))\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}filter\\text{-}generated\\text{-}topology} \\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7FilterGeneratedTopology}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal F,X,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(X)))\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\;\\mathrm{ZfcFilterProperFilter}_S(\\mathcal F(x),X)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall U\\in\\mathcal F(x)\\;\n\\bigl(x\\in U\\land\\exists V\\in\\mathcal F(x)\\;\\forall y\\in V\\;(U\\in\\mathcal F(y))\\bigr)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;(U\\in\\mathcal F(x))\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The pointedness and neighborhood-coherence axioms ensure that the assigned filters are exactly neighborhood filters for the generated topology.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-filter-proper-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"d1121e6ff027ff98","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","headin